WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Sonia: Let's start the Chicago show planning call.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Sergiy: I will send the budget by Friday.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Speaker 3: Can we confirm the venue deposit?

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Sonia: We decided to keep the existing lighting vendor.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Sergiy: Agreed. I will also book the hotel block tomorrow.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Speaker 3: Risk is that the freight might be late.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Sonia: Open question: do we need extra security on Saturday?

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Sergiy: Deadline for the run-of-show is next Tuesday.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Sonia: Decision two: we freeze the guest list today.
